    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Best under one month old · From £200\",\"title\":\"Baby and toddler circumcision\",\"lede\":\"Circumcision can be an anxious time for parents. We aim to make the process as clear and reassuring as possible by explaining what will happen before the appointment, talking you through each stage on the day and providing detailed aftercare afterwards.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Babies and toddlers\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>When you book, we send preparation information and videos explaining what to expect. At the clinic, your son is given local anaesthetic and we check the area before beginning the circumcision.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For many babies and toddlers we use the Plastibell or Circumplast ring method. With this method, a plastic ring is positioned around the head of the penis and the foreskin is secured over it. The unwanted foreskin and ring then separate naturally, usually within 3 to 14 days. No stitches are normally required with the ring method.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"At a glance\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Best age\",\"v\":\"Under one month where possible\"},{\"k\":\"Common method\",\"v\":\"Plastibell / Circumplast ring\"},{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"Procedure time for a young baby\",\"v\":\"Approximately 10 minutes\"},{\"k\":\"Stitches with ring method\",\"v\":\"None\"},{\"k\":\"Ring separation\",\"v\":\"Usually 3–14 days\"},{\"k\":\"Price\",\"v\":\"From £200, depending on age\"}],\"note\":\"From £200, depending on age. See the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/u0022 style=u0022color:var(u002du002dblue-deep)u0022u003efull price listu003c/au003e, broken down by age band.\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Before you come\",\"heading\":\"What to bring\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022 style=u0022max-width:74chu0022u003ern        u003culu003ern          u003cliu003eTight fitting clean nappies and baby wipesu003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eMilk bottle if usedu003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eDummy/ pacifier to soothe the baby. Please buy one for the circumcision even if your son does not use usually use itu003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eBirth certificate/ passport if you have it issuedu003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eRed Booku003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003ePhoto identification for the parentsu003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eAny relevant medical letters if your child has an existing condition (please send this prior to the appointment)u003c/liu003ern        u003c/ulu003ern        u003cp style=u0022margin-top:16pxu0022u003eIf only one parent can attend, or your family circumstances are different, contact the clinic before the appointment so the team can explain the consent and identification documents required.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":false,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Afterwards\",\"heading\":\"After the procedure\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eOnce the procedure is complete, your baby's nappy and clothes can be put back on. You will be given written aftercare instructions and shown what to do at home. The clinic also provides preparation and aftercare videos.u003c/pu003ern        u003cpu003eIf the ring remains attached after the expected period, contact the clinic for advice. Free follow-up appointments are available during the healing period where clinically appropriate. See the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/u0022u003eaftercare pageu003c/au003e for an overview of healing support.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Safety first\",\"heading\":\"When treatment may be delayed\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eCircumcision may be postponed if a baby is unwell or if there are other clinical concerns. We may advise against routine circumcision where there is an anatomical condition such as certain types of hypospadias, because the foreskin can sometimes be needed for later reconstruction. Tell us about any family history of bleeding disorders before the appointment.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"baby-parent\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us first\",\"formId\":\"babies\",\"subject\":\"babies and toddlers enquiry\",\"urgent\":true} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Also at this clinic\",\"heading\":\"Circumcision at other ages\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\",\"banded\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
